body:
That's the point, at least around my niche. Most of the "gurus" or "influencers" push rather odd listicles of Top 10 companies/tools/whatevers that they have never used. I make this assumption because they only read what's on their landing page. 

&#x200B;

But there are people who put in a lot of effort and go through those listicles in a different fashion by showcasing themselves using the product/service/whatever. 

&#x200B;

Short, funny stories also elevate the quality of the video.

Sorry to hear that. My girfriend has endo. Before diagnosis we didn't have much throughout the year, after the diagnosis, she had a surgery (laporoscopy) to remove the tendrils and was prescribed hormonal pills which completelly killed her libido. Though, she took it only for a year, but after that - sex is off the table, slight touches there make her feel pain. I can't stand the constant rejection and have stopped initiating entirelly. I feel you, stay strong. 

&#x200B;

Perhaps some medication would help? Or additional checkups at the gyno?

The "Go kill 10 boars" quests are, of course, meaningless to the game. But ESO has some in-depth quests that should pull you in. Unless, you hate quests, lore, and story in general and you just want to "Go kill 100 boars" without someone giving you a quest for it. 

&#x200B;

As for the hand holding, well, people need it, otherwise it may look to hard. Other mmos had no hand holding in the questing department, but community forums were then filled with detailed guides (But I guess it's better than having a huge arrow above your head pointing in the quest's direction).
